sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Llama Stack Client
    participant Server as Llama Stack Server
    participant Inline as RagasEvaluatorInline<br/>inline::trustyai_ragas
    participant Remote as RagasEvaluatorRemote<br/>remote::trustyai_ragas
    participant DatasetIO as DatasetIO API
    participant Inference as Inference API
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines<br/>API Server
    participant S3 as S3 Storage

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,Inference: Inline Evaluation Flow (synchronous, in-process)
        Client->>Server: Eval request<br/>(evaluate / run_eval)
        Server->>Inline: Route to inline::trustyai_ragas
        Inline->>DatasetIO: iterrows(dataset_id)<br/>Retrieve evaluation dataset
        DatasetIO-->>Inline: Dataset rows
        Inline->>Inline: Wrap Inference API as<br/>LlamaStackInlineLLM +<br/>LlamaStackInlineEmbeddings
        Inline->>Inference: LLM inference calls<br/>(via Ragas wrapper)
        Inference-->>Inline: LLM responses
        Inline->>Inline: Execute Ragas evaluation<br/>asyncio.to_thread(max_workers=1)<br/>Metrics: answer_relevancy,<br/>context_precision, faithfulness,<br/>context_recall
        Inline-->>Server: EvaluateResponse<br/>per-metric ScoringResult aggregations
        Server-->>Client: Evaluation results
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over Client,S3: Remote Evaluation Flow (async, Kubeflow Pipelines)
        Client->>Server: Eval request<br/>(evaluate / run_eval)
        Server->>Remote: Route to remote::trustyai_ragas
        Remote->>KFP: Pre-flight healthz check<br/>Bearer token auth
        KFP-->>Remote: Health OK
        Remote->>KFP: Submit pipeline DAG<br/>Step 1: retrieve_data_from_llama_stack<br/>Step 2: run_ragas_evaluation
        KFP-->>Remote: Run ID (job_id)
        Remote-->>Server: Job submitted (async)
        Server-->>Client: Job ID

        Note over KFP,S3: Pipeline Execution (async in KFP)
        KFP->>Server: Step 1: GET dataset from<br/>Llama Stack API (llama_stack_url)
        Server-->>KFP: Dataset
        KFP->>KFP: Step 2: Run Ragas evaluation<br/>AWS creds from K8s Secret<br/>(kfp.kubernetes.use_secret_as_env)
        KFP->>S3: Write results to<br/>{results_s3_prefix}/{job_id}/results.jsonl
        S3-->>KFP: Write confirmed

        Note over Client,S3: Result Retrieval (polling)
        Client->>Server: Poll for results
        Server->>Remote: Check status
        Remote->>KFP: get_run(run_id)
        KFP-->>Remote: Run status: SUCCEEDED
        Remote->>S3: pandas.read_json(s3_uri)
        S3-->>Remote: results.jsonl
        Remote-->>Server: EvaluateResponse
        Server-->>Client: Evaluation results
    end
